  "an3.60:0.3": "<p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn2'>DN 2</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn11'>DN 11</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn41.4'>SN 41:4</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.35'>AN 4:35</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.95'>AN 4:95—96</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.99'>AN 4:99</a></p>",
